[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4262.47, "timestamp": "01:11:02", "text": "那是这里面最毫发无损的怪物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4264.07, "timestamp": "01:11:04", "text": "游戏。是的。瞧瞧这东西，伙计。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4265.95, "timestamp": "01:11:05", "text": "有趣的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4269.35, "timestamp": "01:11:09", "text": "哦，你错过了他。是那个家伙吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4277.669, "timestamp": "01:11:17", "text": "不是他。不用担心。那是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4314.63, "timestamp": "01:11:54", "text": "等等，他看不到我们。不，他不能。他"}]